      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dashed grey is planned: ADR 0040 and ADR 0041 are Proposed and no Agent is built. Source of truth: docs/adr/0040 and 0041, and identity-and-access.md for the identities and roles. Locally an in-process runner and an MCP stand-in play Foundry and\nAPI Management's MCP server (ADR 0041). Terms are defined in GLOSSARY.md.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dashed grey is planned: ADR 0040 and ADR 0041 are Proposed and no Agent is built. Source of truth: docs/adr/0040 and 0041, and identity-and-access.md for the identities and roles. Locally an in-process runner and an MCP stand-in play Foundry and\nAPI Management's MCP server (ADR 0041). Terms are defined in GLOSSARY.md.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
